## Example Usage

{{ tffile "examples/resources/loadbalancer/health_monitor/main.tf" }}

An `HTTP` or `HTTPS` health monitor can also set `url_path` and `expected_codes`. When they are omitted, the API's defaults are used and read back into the state:

```terraform
resource "conohavps_lb_health_monitor" "http" {
  pool_id        = conohavps_lb_pool.pool_1.id
  name           = "tf-example-monitor-http"
  type           = "HTTP"
  delay          = 10
  timeout        = 5
  max_retries    = 3
  url_path       = "/health"
  expected_codes = "200"
}
```

